{
	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"d95303a3eb28b783",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## **Free Cost Optimization Report**\n\n- Sonrisa gets mor FinOps XP\n- Business Development, Marketing and Sales XP\n- Blog posts\n- First service built on Sonrisa Inference Farm",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-420,
			"y":-330,
			"width":400,
			"height":240
		},
		{
			"id":"89bfe0e8c5527dd8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Sonrisa AI + AWS MCP + AWS Cloud",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-390,
			"y":-560,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"6adc44d4aba6f75f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## **Client**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1000,
			"y":-240,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"7f7c9bc6f8edfc37",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## **Raw raport**\n\nHuman feedback from CPS team\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":320,
			"y":-285,
			"width":260,
			"height":150
		},
		{
			"id":"ba89d5b12a0e2f92",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# AWS",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-880,
			"y":380,
			"width":260,
			"height":140,
			"color":"5"
		},
		{
			"id":"7170375a8192bac9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Sonrisa AI",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-870,
			"y":640,
			"width":260,
			"height":80,
			"color":"5"
		},
		{
			"id":"a3edc52aa37cec35",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Sonrisa AI",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-650,
			"y":1240,
			"width":260,
			"height":80,
			"color":"5"
		},
		{
			"id":"aa8c3dbd9f704d4b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# v0.3 Executive Report Generator Prompt\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-130,
			"y":1200,
			"width":260,
			"height":160,
			"color":"6"
		},
		{
			"id":"6a8ba53422e1d74a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Executive  Report \nThis out put is either a raw document or an MD file",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-670,
			"y":1520,
			"width":300,
			"height":160,
			"color":"5"
		},
		{
			"id":"e72e722345dfc040",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Cloud Engineer Overview\n(max 1 hour)\nWe review the generated file, most specifically the current state and the conclusions. It must make sense as we will need to present this.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-220,
			"y":1500,
			"width":400,
			"height":200,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"c77e25da71111c29",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"The idea is that with max. 4 hours of Engineer time and max 2 hours of Management time, we should conduct this report making sure that during this we \n\n**Validate the client**\nWe make sure that we would like to work with this client: is his infra large enough that we can indeed collaborate effectively with this client. \n\nHow the client conducted himself during collaboration? Were they cooperative? Can we actually help them? Is there long term opportunity?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":0,
			"y":360,
			"width":520,
			"height":420
		},
		{
			"id":"dd44598b7e044617",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## v0.1 Technical Report Generator Prompt",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1280,
			"y":910,
			"width":280,
			"height":100,
			"color":"6"
		},
		{
			"id":"f105ddf4055949bd",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Raw Report\nThis is generated using an MCP server and the AWS infra of the client",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-915,
			"y":880,
			"width":350,
			"height":160,
			"color":"5"
		},
		{
			"id":"485b2507cfb865be",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Case Study\n\nClient context",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-460,
			"y":598,
			"width":440,
			"height":165,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"8f93be4133cd6409",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Cloud Engineer Feedback\n(1-3 hours of investigation)\nThis is a structured human feedback which would drive the decisions that are included in the report",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-460,
			"y":875,
			"width":440,
			"height":165,
			"color":"4"
		}
	],
